From afbb91e525c3840c026e3dacf2e1e01cab1eb4dc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gili Tzabari <cowwoc2020@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 19:54:32 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Port the network proxy to rama 0.4

Rama 0.4 removed ProxyTarget, StreamForwardService and PeekStream and changed the SOCKS5 acceptor to take an executor, so the network proxy forwards streams, replays peeked prefixes and relays SOCKS5 through the new APIs.
